    "updated_at": "2025-09-16T15:44:50Z",
    "body": "> I now also wonder at what point implementations ask WebDriver for this value as it seems unlikely to happen in het network layer, where the User-Agent value is currently appended.\r\n\r\n@annevk in Chromium, we rely on [`Emulation.setUserAgentOverride`](https://chromedevtools.github.io/devtools-protocol/tot/Emulation/#method-setUserAgentOverride) method, which sets the user agent override, which is [read in the renderer](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/loader/frame_loader.cc;drc=48d6f7175422b2c969c14258f9f8d5b196c28d18;l=1496).",
