    "created_at": "2025-09-16T17:28:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-09-16T17:28:05Z",
    "body": "> I see. So you are you saying it's set before navigation starts and can't be changed after?\n\nTheoretically the user can change the emulation during navigation, but otherwise it is persistent per top-level navigable. I cannot imagine a real-world automation scenario when the user needs to change emulation during navigation and expect persistent results. ",
